@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# portfolio
+
+This package contains research-only portfolio construction. It does not create
+orders, connect to brokers, or call execution or risk modules.
+
+Available constructors and utilities:
+
+- Equal-weight allocation over active signals.
+- Inverse-volatility allocation using prior realized returns.
+- Long-only, minimum-weight, maximum-weight, and gross-leverage constraints.
+- Fractional risk contributions and iterative risk-parity weights.
+
+Every constructor returns a date/symbol weight panel suitable for the
+backtesting engine. Constraints fail explicitly when an allocation is
+infeasible instead of silently violating limits.
